id: ensenji
name: Ensenji
kind: gear
tags: food
# "You can spend 1 Action to consume this Basic Item."
placeCost: 1
# Its Details. Consumable: "destroyed once it is used".
details: food, consumable
# "Regain all of your Life and Ki Points, up to their maximum."
healFull: true
healKi: true
# The Awakening is not here yet: the card says it.
consumeNote: gains a stack of the Unlocked Potential Awakening as a Level 1 Temporary Awakening
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Consume it for an Action: all your Life and Ki Points back, and a stack of the Unlocked Potential
  Awakening as a Level 1 Temporary Awakening.
text: >
  Ensenji: This powerful fruit bears the magical ability to restore you to full health, making you
  stronger in the process.
  –Details: Food, Consumable
  –Effects: You can spend 1 Action to consume this Basic Item. If you do, regain all of your Life and
  Ki Points, up to their maximum. Additionally, gain a stack of the Unlocked Potential Awakening as a
  Level 1 Temporary Awakening.

---

# --- What the system does ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Consume: 1 Action, Life and Ki Points to their maximum, and it is used up. The card says the
# Awakening.
#
# --- What is not built -------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The Unlocked Potential Awakening, and Temporary Awakenings: Transformations are not in this system
# yet. Gaining it is the table's until they are.
